# DESIGN-SYSTEM — dotdog

> Describes existing design tokens and patterns from `docs/assets/css/style.scss`, `docs/_includes/head-custom.html`, and the dotdog CLI output.

---

## Surfaces

| Surface | Stack | File |
|---------|-------|------|
| Docs website | Jekyll + GitHub Pages | `docs/assets/css/style.scss` |
| CLI output | Node.js / Bun terminal | `packages/dotdog/src/cli.ts` |
| npm README | Markdown | `packages/dotdog/README.md` |

---

## Tokens

### Colors

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `white` | `#ffffff` | Body background |
| `ink` | `#1a1a2e` | Body text, headings |
| `ink-muted` | `#6b7280` | Secondary text, blockquote, nav |
| `ink-subtle` | `#334155` | Table cell text |
| `ink-dark` | `#1e293b` | Pre code, table headers |
| `ink-h3` | `#374151` | H3 headings |
| `accent` | `#2563eb` | Links |
| `accent-hover` | `#d97706` | Nav hover |
| `code-bg` | `#f1f5f9` | Inline code, pre blocks |
| `code-red` | `#9d174d` | Inline code text |
| `border` | `#e5e7eb` | Dividers, h2 underline, blockquote, footer |
| `border-pre` | `#cbd5e1` | Pre block border |
| `border-table` | `#e2e8f0` | Table row dividers |
| `th-bg` | `#f8fafc` | Table header background |
| `blockquote-bg` | `#f9fafb` | Blockquote background |
| `footer` | `#9ca3af` | Footer text |

### Typography

| Token | Value |
|-------|-------|
| `font-family` | `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif` |
| `h1-size` | `2.2em` |
| `h2-size` | `1.3em` |
| `h3-size` | `1.05em` |
| `body-size` | `1em` (browser default) |
| `table-size` | `0.92em` |
| `inline-code-size` | `0.88em` |
| `pre-code-size` | `0.84em` |
| `footer-size` | `0.85em` |
| `nav-size` | `0.9em` |
| `line-height` | `1.7` (body), `1.6` (pre code) |
| `font-weight-body` | `400` |
| `font-weight-heading` | `700` (h1), inherited (h2, h3) |
| `font-weight-strong` | `600` (th), `500` (inline code, nav) |

