| `page-padding` | `0 24px` |
| `header-top` | `48px` |
| `header-bottom` | `16px` |
| `footer-top` | `48px` |
| `footer-padding` | `24px` |
| `h2-top` | `40px` |
| `h3-top` | `24px` |
| `blockquote-margin` | `16px 0` |
| `blockquote-padding` | `8px 16px` |
| `table-margin` | `16px 0` |
| `table-cell-padding` | `10px 14px` |
| `pre-padding` | `16px 20px` |
| `code-padding` | `2px 6px` |

### Radii

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `radius-sm` | `3px` | Inline code |
| `radius-md` | `4px` | Blockquote right corners |
| `radius-lg` | `6px` | Pre blocks |

---

## Components

### Navigation
- Horizontal flex, centered, `gap: 24px`
- Links: `#6b7280`, hover `#d97706`, size `0.9em`, weight 500
- Present on every docs page

### Code blocks
- Inline: `background: #f1f5f9`, `padding: 2px 6px`, `border-radius: 3px`, `color: #9d174d`
- Pre: `background: #f1f5f9`, `border: 1px solid #cbd5e1`, `border-radius: 6px`, `padding: 16px 20px`
- Pre code: `font-size: 0.84em`, `line-height: 1.6`, no background/border/padding

### Tables
- Full width, collapsed borders
- Row dividers: `border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0`
- Header: `background: #f8fafc`, `font-weight: 600`

### Blockquotes
- Left border: `3px solid #e5e7eb`
- Background: `#f9fafb`
- Right border-radius: `4px`

---

## Constraints

- All docs pages share identical nav and font-family
- Back-nav on subpages: `← specdog · guide · for agents`
- Code blocks must have copy buttons (dark `#1e293b` background, checkmark animation)
- Version footer auto-fetched from npm: `fetch('https://registry.npmjs.org/dotdog/latest')`
- No JS frameworks — vanilla HTML + CSS
- CLI output uses chalk for terminal colors (commander for structure)
